Vendored Wedos DNS provider for Caddy
=====================================

This directory is a single self-contained Go module that lets Caddy solve the
ACME DNS-01 challenge against WEDOS DNS (via the WEDOS WAPI). It is vendored
in-tree on purpose: the build does NOT fetch the third-party caddy-dns/wedos
plugin from the internet. The Caddy image is built against this local copy
(see ../Containerfile, `xcaddy build --with lab2.pacmag.cz/caddy-wedos=...`).

Only the WAPI client and the thin Caddy wrapper are vendored here. Caddy itself
(github.com/caddyserver/caddy/v2) and the libdns interface
(github.com/libdns/libdns) are still pulled from their official upstreams at
build time — they are not the trust concern this vendoring addresses.

